data.value:
Ezinye iiflegi ozama ukuzingenisa sele zinamaxabiso amiselweyo. Ngaba ungathanda ukubhala ngaphezulu kwamaxabiso azo angoku kunye nalawo achaziweyo kungeniso?

Kukho {0} iinkcazelo zeflegi eziphikisanayo:
{1}

I- JSON oyifakileyo ayibonakali isebenza. Nceda uyijonge kabini kwaye uzame kwakhona.

Ulwazi oluthe vetshe:
{0}

Ifolda oyikhethileyo ukuyifaka i- Voidstrap ukuba sele ikhona kwaye AKUKHO nto. Kucetyiswa ngamandla ukuba i- Voidstrap ifakwe kwifolda yayo ezimeleyo.
Ukutshintshela kule ndawo ilandelayo kuyacetyiswa: {0}
Ngaba ungathanda ukutshintshela kwindawo ecetyisiweyo? Ukukhetha 'Hayi' akuyi kuhoya esi silumkiso kwaye iqhubeke nofakelo.

Layita imodeli ye- Voidstrap "{0}"? Iimodyuli ze-

{1}

 Voidstrap zinokutshintsha indlela i- Voidstrap esebenza ngayo kwaye itshintshe iisetingi zayo. Vula kuphela iimodys ozithembileyo.

Faka "{0}" {1} ngu @{2}?

{3}

Voidstrap ijonga yonke ifayile ngokuchasene nethala leencwadi phambi kokuyifakela, kwaye ibuze phambi kokuba uvule imod.

Le mod ithatha indawo yeefayile eziye zezinye iimods ezinikwe amandla nazo zithathe indawo:

{0}

Iimodyuli eziQhubekileyo zinokwenza i- Roblox ibonakale okanye iziphathe ngendlela engaqhelekanga, kodwa oku akunako ukungqubana Voidstrap. Cima enye yazo ukuba kukho into engalunganga.
